ss=\"bb_paragraph\" >Preview and adjust camera settings in real-time.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Advanced lighting control for angles and color temperatures.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Full weather control for time of day, sun rotation, and fog density.</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3237260/extras/52a249948285b9e564e1475b6cd04bb5.webp?t=1750132447\" width=617 height=34 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Capture high-quality images of your scenes to showcase your work.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Add keyframes to the timeline  to create videos and export as MP4.</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3237260/extras/af9ce6e63977f16c2cef8021b08125cb.avif?t=1750132447\" width=617 height=72 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Need help or have feedback?\u00a0</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Visit our website/youtube channel for comprehensive tutorials.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Email us directly.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Join the discussion on our Steam forum.</p></li></ul>",
